ios: offline "New User" opens the login form

The bundled world has no account server: logging in with a new name creates the character (on Tutorial
Island). Upstream's "New User" screen tells the player to create an account on the website, which is a
dead end offline, so the button now opens the login form with a hint ("New character: choose any username
and password.").

